// macro-parenthesis-adjacency.  Measured against the established compiler.
// A FORM FEED IN ORDINARY CODE.  The established compiler refuses it - error C0000:
// syntax error, unexpected $undef - and we used to ACCEPT it, because
// std::isspace skips it.  Pre-existing, closed here because the fix belongs in
// the lexer and not in the #define handler: the character matters exactly when
// it reaches the TOKEN STREAM.
float4 main(float4 t : TEXCOORD0) : COLOR { returnt * 2.0; }
